subha gya to bahut dar lag rha tha raste me lekin fir main gate ke under chala gya. fir main gate ke under gya wo army wla gate jo tune dekha tha waha road pe cycle chala rha tha aur udhr se gate se jo bache aa rhe the usko dekh rha tha . mai soch rha tha mere class ka ya jo mujhe janta ho wo na aaye koi. fir school ke gate pe paucha aur cycle se utar ke under gya 😭😭

cycle stand me cycle lagane gya to kuch log jo mughe jante the dost type ke dikhe. wo sb log aaye bol rhe the itne dino baad dikh rhe ho. bol rhe the dusre school me chala gyata yaha kaise padhega. fir mai bola kaash mai kar pata.

fir school ke under jane laga chup chup ke, darte hue. mere class wale v dikh rhe the lekin mai chup rha tha kisi na kisi ke piche aur ja rha tha. class me gya aur bag rakh diya piche khidki ke pas ek seat mili jaha. fir pani piyad aur fir assembly me jane ke liye bulane aa gye sb

fir assembly me gya. udher sara bacha mil gya line me. mera ek dost v mil gya jisse whatsapp pe msg kr rha tha school me kya chal rha h. mai niche dekhte hue ja rha tha. fir usne mujhe dekha aur aa gya mere pas aur pucha roz aayega? meri aankh me aansu aa gye the. mai side me piche chala gya aur aansu control kiya. bahut rona aa rha tha us waqt. fir wapas aaya kuch bol nhi pa rha tha fir mere dost ne bata diya meri line kaunsi hai aur apni line me chala gya.

fir mere class ke kuch ladke jo piche lag the line me unhone mujhe dekha. mujhe bahut ajeeb lag rha tha. assembly me poore time sir ghuma v nhi paya. bas aage dekhta rha.

assembly khatam hui to achha hua pehle unki line gyi fir meri line. nhi to poori class khadi rehti aur mai unke samne se ja rha hota. fir mai niche dekhte hue apni line me chal rha tha.

fir apne class me gya. 1st period games tha. sab bache chal gye bahar. mai school ko dekh rha tha class ke bahar khada hoke. udher ke ped aur har chiz jo mujhe bahut pasand thi. soch rha tha yahi mai aaya tha na principal sir se milne aur unhone nahi bola tha. yahi jagah aa gya na mai fir se jisse mujhe sabse zyada pyaar tha aur ab sabse zyada dar lag rha hai.

poora school shant tha us waqt. koi bahar nhi dikh rha tha. bahut kam log dikh rhe the. mai bas school ke ped aur school ko dekhe ja rha tha lagbhag 40 minute tak.

games khatam hua to class me gya. attendance ke waqt present bhi nhi bol paya. itna nervous tha. fir us waqt wo har chiz aur meri galti ki yaad aa rhi thi jisse mera sab kuch mujhse dur chala gya.

fir 3rd aur 4th period physics tha. poori time subha se mera hath kaap rha tha. bahut nervous tha. dar bhi tha physics padhte waqt dhyan nhi ja rha tha. try kar rha tha lekin dimag kahi aur tha. padh v rha tha to samajh nhi aa rha tha. sir dard ho rha tha aur bahut ajeeb sa feel ho rha tha.

lunch me v kuch nhi khaya. mera dost aaya aaya aur puch rha tha tu itna sad ku hai. mujhe rona aa rha tha lekin control kar rha tha khirki ki taraf dekh ke. wo bol rha tha bahar chal lekin mai bahar nhi ja pa rha tha. class se bahar jane ki himmat hi nhi thi. fir bol rha tha chal 12th A me chal. lekin mai bilkul nhi gya kahi. class me hi baitha raha pure lunch me

fir lunch ke baad games mil gya fir se. is bar sir mujhe v bahar le gye. mai khada hoke dekh rha tha

fir next period hindi aur cs tha. cs ke teacher aaye nhi the to ham bas baithe the. mai head down karke baitha tha.

fir last ke 2 period maths tha. maths wale sir aaye aur bole Aditya kaha hai. maine hath uthaya lekin mai bahut dar gya tha us waqt. fir unhone kuch bola nhi. bas dekha aur padhane lage. mai likh rha tha lekin poora din bahut udaas tha. kone me baitha tha. kabhi khidki se bahar dekhta tha kabhi sochta tha ye sab kya ho gya.

fir sir ne achanak question puch liya. mai dar gya aur class ke samne khada ho gya lekin answer de diya. fir mujhe baitha diya.

chutti hui aur mai bahar jane laga. tabhi maine dekha samne se Mahi aa rhi thi. bahut bhid ke bich aur dur thi lekin mai pehchan gya. mai uske samne nhi aana chahta tha. dur se hi nikal gya lekin aankh usi ko dekh rhi thi. itne dino baad dekha tha.

fir mai piche ke raste se nikal gya school ke main raste se nhi. bahut mushkil se apne class ke boys aur girls ke bich se hote hue cycle stand ke pas gya. fir udher khada ho gya. sabke jane ka wait kiya.

udher fir se Mahi aayi aur cycle le ke ja rhi thi. mai dur se dekh rha tha. uska bag aalag tha is bar aur koi cap laga ke ja rhe the dhoop tha isliye bishnu v uske sath cap laga ke ja rha tha 

fir bhid kam hui to cycle le ke nikal gya. fir piche wale raste se hi gya. bahut der wait kiya tha taaki school khali ho jaye.

fir itni dhoop me bina khana khaye aur bina theek se pani piye ghar aaya.

aaj ka din bahut ajeeb tha. subha se kuch khane ka man nhi kr rha h aur bhook v nhi lag rhi h poora din dar, jo khoya uska dard aur ghabrahat me nikla. hath kaap rhe the pure time😭 aur mai fir se bilkul nhi jana cahata fir se ye sab sahana padega mughse nhi hoga ye mai jeeyunga kaise school me aaise school me padhne jate h lekin mai aaise me padhunga kaise
